# What does not go in the VSIX.
#
# The extension and the language server are bundled by esbuild into
# `dist/extension.cjs` and `server/bin.js`, and `vsce package --no-dependencies`
# is what makes that the whole of it — without the flag, vsce copies
# `node_modules` in as well and ships a second, unbundled copy of every runtime
# dependency alongside the bundle that already contains them.
#
# `tests/vscode-extension.test.ts` reads the packaged file and fails if anything
# below appears in it, because a `.vscodeignore` that has silently stopped
# matching looks exactly like one that works.
src/**
node_modules/**
tsconfig.json
*.tsbuildinfo
.vscodeignore
